invariant: INV-35
file: Makefile
catches: test/lib-check-webpki-tcp-nonblocking.sh
reason: The object compiles with C11's strict aliasing rule on. Each public
  call reads a caller's ch_tls, ch_tcp, ch_quic or ch_dnssec_hash storage as
  the _priv struct in it, so an optimizer may then reorder a read and a write
  of one object as two (docs/decisions.md 185). lib-check reads the flag in
  the object's compile line and refuses the object.

--- old
CFLAGS += -fno-strict-aliasing
--- new
CFLAGS +=
